{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23352","headline":"有感三首 二 · 白居易","name":"有感三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫养瘦马驹，莫教小妓女。\n後事在目前，不信君看取。\n马肥快行走，妓长能歌舞。\n三年五岁间，已闻换一主。\n借问新旧主，谁乐谁辛苦。\n请君大带上，把笔书此语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}